// Asset catalog — the single registry that knows where physical art
// files live. Each entry is keyed by an opaque asset id and carries
// only the file path; rendering decisions (which game-object uses
// which asset, what footprint to render at) belong with the object
// definition, not here.
//
// Source PNGs live under `public/art/` (Vite serves that as the site
// root); paths here are absolute under that root.
{
  catalog: {
    'bed-flop': { path: '/art/objects/bed-flop.png' },
  },
}
